    {
      "id": "intro_1",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "How did Sam get his money back?",
      "translation": "萨姆是怎样把钱拿回来的？",
      "startTime": 10.18,
      "endTime": 14.69,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "How",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "怎样，如何"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_2",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "The whole village soon learnt that a large sum of money had been lost.",
      "translation": "整个村子很快知道了有一大笔钱丢失了。",
      "startTime": 14.7,
      "endTime": 21,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_3",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Sam Benton, the local butcher,",
      "translation": "当地的屠户萨姆·本顿",
      "startTime": 21.01,
      "endTime": 24.32,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "had lost his wallet while taking his savings to the post office.",
      "translation": "在把存款送往邮局的途中把钱包丢了。",
      "startTime": 24.33,
      "endTime": 30.28,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Sam was sure that the wallet must have been found by one of the villagers,",
      "translation": "萨姆确信钱包肯定是被某个村民捡到了，",
      "startTime": 30.29,
      "endTime": 36.73,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "That",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "那个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "but it was not returned to him.",
      "translation": "可是没有人还给他。",
      "startTime": 36.74,
      "endTime": 40.42,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          },
          {
            "word": "Not",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "不，不是"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Three months passed, and then one morning, Sam found his wallet outside his front door.",
      "translation": "3个月过去了，后来有一天早晨，萨姆在自己的前门外发现了他的钱包。",
      "startTime": 40.43,
      "endTime": 49.06,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "It had been wrapped up in newspaper and it contained half the money he had lost,",
      "translation": "钱包是用报纸包着的，里面有他丢失的钱的一半，",
      "startTime": 49.07,
      "endTime": 56.08,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "It",
            "pos": "pron.",
            "meaning": "它"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "together with a note which said:",
      "translation": "还附着一张纸条，上面写着：",
      "startTime": 56.09,
      "endTime": 59.05,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "'A thief, yes, but only 50 per cent a thief!'",
      "translation": "'一个小偷，是的，但只是一个50%的小偷！'",
      "startTime": 59.06,
      "endTime": 65.12,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Yes",
            "pos": "adv.",
            "meaning": "是的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Two months later,",
      "translation": "两个月后，",
      "startTime": 65.13,
      "endTime": 66.8,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "some more money was sent to Sam with another note:",
      "translation": "又寄来了一些钱，还附着另一张纸条：",
      "startTime": 66.81,
      "endTime": 72.11,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s9",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "'Only 25 per cent a thief now!'",
      "translation": "'现在只是25%的小偷了！'",
      "startTime": 72.12,
      "endTime": 76.31,
      "analysis": {
        "words": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "In time, all Sam's money was paid back in this way.",
      "translation": "后来，萨姆的钱以这种方式全都退回来了。",
      "startTime": 76.32,
      "endTime": 82.33,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
