            "meaning": "这，这个"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "The last note said: 'I am 100 per cent honest now!'",
      "translation": "最后一张纸条上写着：'我现在是百分之百的诚实了！'",
      "startTime": 82.34,
      "endTime": 87.34,
